{
  "title": "【相談】為替レートを見すぎてスーパーの値札まで売買サインに見えるんだが",
  "body": "<div class=\"neko-thread\"><div class=\"neko-res-list\"><div class=\"res\" id=\"res1\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">1：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:15:00 ID:Ax7Kp2Qm</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">最近ドル円のチャートばっかり見てたせいか、スーパーの値札が全部レートに見える。<br>昨日は豆腐98円を見て『二桁突入か』と呟いた。<br>今日、卵158円の前で『ここは売りだな』って言ってしまった。<br>これどうやったら治る？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res2\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">2：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:15:22 ID:Bn4Rz8Tq</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">とりあえずチャート閉じろ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res3\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">3：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:15:49 ID:Cy9Hs3Lv</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">末期だな。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res4\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">4：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:16:13 ID:Dp2Fw7Jk</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">卵を売るなｗ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res5\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">5：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:16:36 ID:Em8Qc4Zn</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">98円の豆腐は買いだろ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res6\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">6：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:17:08 ID:Ft3Ny9Gb</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\"><a href=\"#res5\">&gt;&gt;5</a> もうお前も感染してる。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res7\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">7：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:17:29 ID:Gw6Ld2Sr</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">スーパーでポジション持つなよ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res8\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">8：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:18:01 ID:Hv5Pk7Cx</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">卵158円は高値掴みか？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res9\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">9：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:18:22 ID:Jq9Bt4Me</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">特売待ちが正解。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res10\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">10：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:18:59 ID:Kr2Vs8Na</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">俺はガソリンスタンドの数字見ると反応する。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res11\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">11：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:19:28 ID:Ls7Fg3Wp</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">それは普通に家計が気になるだけだろ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res12\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">12：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:20:01 ID:Mt4Xc6Qh</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">最近ずっとモニターに張り付いてるの？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res13\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">13：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:20:37 ID:Ax7Kp2Qm</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\"><a href=\"#res12\">&gt;&gt;12</a> 平日は帰宅後ずっと。土日も過去チャート見てる。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res14\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">14：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:21:09 ID:Nn8Dj2Ky</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">土日は休めよｗ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res15\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">15：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:21:42 ID:Pp5Rm9Sf</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">値札をチャートと思うなら買い物メモ作っとけ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res16\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">16：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:22:09 ID:Qy3Ha6Tv</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">メモに『利確：牛乳』とか書きそう。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res17\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">17：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:22:43 ID:Ax7Kp2Qm</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">実は昨日、買い物メモに『損切り：もやし』って書いた。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res18\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">18：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:23:12 ID:Bn4Rz8Tq</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">もやしに何されたんだ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res19\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">19：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:23:46 ID:Cy9Hs3Lv</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">もやしは安定通貨。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res20\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">20：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:24:19 ID:Dp2Fw7Jk</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">もやしの価値を為替で語るスレ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res21\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">21：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:24:47 ID:Em8Qc4Zn</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">店員に変な目で見られてないか？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res22\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">22：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:25:22 ID:Ax7Kp2Qm</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">昨日レジで『約定お願いします』って言いかけた。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res23\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">23：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:25:48 ID:Ft3Ny9Gb</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">危ないｗ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res24\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">24：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:26:21 ID:Gw6Ld2Sr</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">レジは成行注文しか受け付けません。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res25\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">25：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:26:56 ID:Hv5Pk7Cx</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">指値で買えるスーパーがあったら嫌だな。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res26\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">26：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:27:23 ID:Jq9Bt4Me</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">客『大根100円になったら買います』</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res27\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">27：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:27:54 ID:Kr2Vs8Na</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">店員『注文を受け付けました』</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res28\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">28：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:28:26 ID:Ls7Fg3Wp</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">その間に他の客が持っていく。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res29\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">29：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:28:59 ID:Mt4Xc6Qh</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">流動性の問題か。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res30\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">30：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:29:25 ID:Nn8Dj2Ky</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">大根市場、薄商い。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res31\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">31：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:30:01 ID:Pp5Rm9Sf</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">値札の赤い数字を見ると下落に見えるの？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res32\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">32：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:30:33 ID:Ax7Kp2Qm</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\"><a href=\"#res31\">&gt;&gt;31</a> 赤札を見ると反射的に買い場だと思う。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res33\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">33：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:31:04 ID:Qy3Ha6Tv</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">それはスーパーでは正常。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res34\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">34：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:31:37 ID:Bn4Rz8Tq</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">むしろ特売の本質を理解している。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res35\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">35：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:32:08 ID:Cy9Hs3Lv</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">本当の問題は口に出すことだな。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res36\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">36：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:32:34 ID:Dp2Fw7Jk</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">一度、店員に聞いてみろよ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res37\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">37：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:33:07 ID:Ax7Kp2Qm</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">何を？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res38\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">38：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:33:40 ID:Dp2Fw7Jk</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">『この豆腐のサポートラインはどこですか』</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res39\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">39：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:34:14 ID:Em8Qc4Zn</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">出禁になるぞｗ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res40\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">40：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:34:40 ID:Ft3Ny9Gb</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">普通に買い物して帰れ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res41\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">41：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:35:15 ID:Gw6Ld2Sr</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">俺も相場にハマってた頃、テレビの天気予報の矢印に反応した。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res42\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">42：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:35:48 ID:Hv5Pk7Cx</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">上昇気流は買いか。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res43\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">43：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:36:16 ID:Jq9Bt4Me</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">台風は暴落。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res44\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">44：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:36:50 ID:Kr2Vs8Na</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">お前ら全員チャートから離れろ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res45\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">45：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:37:22 ID:Ls7Fg3Wp</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\"><a href=\"#res1\">&gt;&gt;1</a> 今日はもうスーパー行った？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res46\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">46：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:37:54 ID:Ax7Kp2Qm</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\"><a href=\"#res45\">&gt;&gt;45</a> まだ。夕飯の材料を買いに行く予定。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res47\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">47：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 2007/10/17(水) 19:38:29 ID:Mt4Xc6Qh</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">じゃあ帰ってきたら報告してくれ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res48\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">48：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">Trader＠Live!</span> 200